@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<p>
    <hr />
    Your privacy is important to us. This page explains what information we collect in QuizApp, how we use it, and how we protect it.
</p>

<h4>What data do we collect?</h4>
<ul>
    <li>Basic app usage data (e.g., number of quizzes taken, scores).</li>
    <li>Optional contact information, if you provide it (such as registering on the scoreboard).</li>
</ul>

<h4>How do we use your data?</h4>
<ul>
    <li>To improve user experience and personalize quizzes.</li>
    <li>To analyze statistics for app improvement.</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h4>Data Protection</h4>
<ul>
    <li>We protect your data in accordance with applicable laws and do not share it with third parties.</li>
    <li>All personal data is stored securely and only as long as necessary.</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h4>Your Rights</h4>
<ul>
    <li>You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data.</li>
    <li>You can contact us at any time with questions about your data.</li>
</ul>

<p>
    For questions, please contact <a href="mailto:support@quizapp.com">support@quizapp.com</a>.
    <hr />
</p>
